### Follow a user
POST http://localhost:3000/backend/api/followers/follow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "followerUsername": "alice",
  "followingUsername": "bob"
}

### Unfollow a user
POST http://localhost:3000/backend/api/followers/unfollow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "followerUsername": "alice",
  "followingUsername": "bob"
}

### Get followers of a user
GET http://localhost:3000/backend/api/followers/bob
Accept: application/json

### Get following list of a user
GET http://localhost:3000/backend/api/followers?username=alice
Accept: application/json